# Power loss during observation persistence
name: power-loss-observation
version: 1
description: Power loss after append commits; record survives, sequence continues.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
crash_append 1
read CHIP-002
reboot
assert observations 2
assert next_sequence 3
assert observation 0 sequence 1
assert observation 1 sequence 2
assert observation 0 chip_id CHIP-001
assert observation 1 chip_id CHIP-002
read CHIP-003
assert observations 3
assert next_sequence 4
assert sequences_unique
assert sequences_monotonic